1202:- ANOMALY: `Lease Record` carried an invented constraint. Section 5.3 declares `predecessor_lease_id` "Null only at epoch 1", "An epoch-1 `create` lease MUST have a null predecessor", and `checkpoint_id` "Null only for epoch-1 `create`". It nowhere declares that epoch 1 implies `reason = create`, and that inference refused a legitimate epoch-1 `recovery` lease. Removed both inferred directions; the checkpoint rule now correctly covers the whole complement of epoch-1-`create`, which the old epoch-only form missed. Third invented-constraint finding across the m0 leaves.
